    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Hustle</strong> is a wild, fast-paced management sim where you turn a small tech shop into a booming empire! Juggle deliveries, haggle with customers, hire quirky employees, and upgrade to robots that handle it all\u2014while you take a coffee break. But watch out! The black market offers juicy deals on rare tech\u2026 if you\u2019re willing to bend a few rules. Will you play it safe or hustle your way to the top?<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/2eea5ace3a3ba9d572f7ecb47fb6528c.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/2eea5ace3a3ba9d572f7ecb47fb6528c.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/2eea5ace3a3ba9d572f7ecb47fb6528c.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Online and Physical Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/8eea2c608dc20ad4b9994f91b25cdbe5.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/8eea2c608dc20ad4b9994f91b25cdbe5.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/8eea2c608dc20ad4b9994f91b25cdbe5.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Store</strong>: Make your store look fabulous or hilariously awful\u2014it\u2019s your choice! Just be ready for customer reviews like, \u201cGreat prices, but what\u2019s up with the neon toilets?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/c48646a60eca71d0dcd1189d8ba37518.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/c48646a60eca71d0dcd1189d8ba37518.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/c48646a60eca71d0dcd1189d8ba37518.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Products and Sell Online &amp; In-Store</strong>: Manage two stores at once for double the fun and chaos\u2014because who doesn\u2019t love juggling a sale while handling refund emails?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/d6bb0a74f309b7ebdf4cbf89f9138fc1.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/d6bb0a74f309b7ebdf4cbf89f9138fc1.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/d6bb0a74f309b7ebdf4cbf89f9138fc1.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery System</strong>: Got a van? Great! Now race through traffic to get your orders delivered before customers start a protest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/66e3409f78d324123234aa30af04f708.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/66e3409f78d324123234aa30af04f708.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/66e3409f78d324123234aa30af04f708.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone Delivery</strong>: Who needs a driver\u2019s license when you\u2019ve got drones that sometimes deliver the package\u2026 and sometimes crash into trees?  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/30438091beb0a0962f929de3ee2e2e3a.poster.avif?t=1731513010\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/30438091beb0a0962f929de3ee2e2e3a.webm?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077220/extras/30438091beb0a0962f929de3ee2e2e3a.mp4?t=1731513010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Day/Night</strong>: Watch your store come alive during the day and get creepily quiet at night\u2026 except for that weird customer browsing until 3 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster